Package: poistree
Type: Package
Title: Bayesian Poisson Point Process Tree Models
Version: 0.1.1
Date: 2026-08-10
Authors@R: c(person("Pulong", "Ma", role=c("aut", "cre"), email="plma@iastate.edu"))
Maintainer: Pulong Ma <mpulong@gmail.com>
Description: Bayesian Poisson process trees for intensity estimation on
    possibly high-dimensional input spaces. The extensible unified interface
    separates the gating mechanism, intensity structure, scale prior, and
    posterior sampler. The implemented model is a hard-gated terminal-leaf
    Poisson process tree fitted by sequential Monte Carlo, reversible-jump
    Markov chain Monte Carlo, or Particle Gibbs with ancestor sampling.
License: GPL (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
